on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 17 ............................. <17>
  [  2] pushint8 17 ............................. <17>
  [  4] pusharglist 1 ........................... <17>
  [  6] extcall 48 .............................. <rollOver(17)>
  [  8] pushint8 25 ............................. <25>
  [ 10] set 6 ................................... set the visible of sprite 17 to rollOver(17)
  [ 12] pushint8 18 ............................. <18>
  [ 14] pushint8 18 ............................. <18>
  [ 16] pusharglist 1 ........................... <18>
  [ 18] extcall 48 .............................. <rollOver(18)>
  [ 20] pushint8 25 ............................. <25>
  [ 22] set 6 ................................... set the visible of sprite 18 to rollOver(18)
  [ 24] pushint8 17 ............................. <17>
  [ 26] pusharglist 1 ........................... <17>
  [ 28] extcall 48 .............................. <rollOver(17)>
  [ 30] pushint8 18 ............................. <18>
  [ 32] pusharglist 1 ........................... <18>
  [ 34] extcall 48 .............................. <rollOver(18)>
  [ 36] or ...................................... <rollOver(17) or rollOver(18)>
  [ 37] pushint8 32 ............................. <32>
  [ 39] pusharglist 1 ........................... <32>
  [ 41] extcall 48 .............................. <rollOver(32)>
  [ 43] or ...................................... <rollOver(17) or rollOver(18) or rollOver(32)>
  [ 44] pushint8 33 ............................. <33>
  [ 46] pusharglist 1 ........................... <33>
  [ 48] extcall 48 .............................. <rollOver(33)>
  [ 50] or ...................................... <rollOver(17) or rollOver(18) or rollOver(32) or rollOver(33)>
  [ 51] jmpifz [ 68] ............................ if rollOver(17) or rollOver(18) or rollOver(32) or rollOver(33) then / else
  [ 54] pushint8 81 ............................. <81>
  [ 56] pushint8 82 ............................. <82>
  [ 58] pusharglist 2 ........................... <[81, 82]>
  [ 60] pushlist ................................ <[81, 82]>
  [ 61] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <[81, 82]>
  [ 63] extcall 49 .............................. cursor([81, 82])
  [ 65] jmp [ 73]
  [ 68] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 69] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <0>
  [ 71] extcall 49 .............................. cursor(0)
  [ 73] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [ 75] thebuiltin 25 ........................... <the frame>
  [ 77] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <the frame>
  [ 79] extcall 24 .............................. go(the frame)
  [ 81] ret
end
